OL,3,AAt least 33 pupils and teacher killed
OL,4,Aafter school roof collapses in Pakistan
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 33 pupils and a teacher have
OL,7,Fbeen killed after a school roof
OL,8,Fcollapsed in the north-western
OL,9,FPakistani city of Peshawar, according
OL,10,Fto hospital officials.
OL,12,FMore than a dozen others are injured,
OL,13,Fwith some in a critical condition.
OL,14,FSeveral children are feared to be
OL,15,Ftrapped under the rubble.
OL,17,FEmergency services were alerted to the
OL,18,Fincident at the private Al-Khair school
OL,19,Fin Dir Colony at 08:48 (03:48 GMT) on
OL,20,FThursday after lessons had begun, a
OL,21,Frescue official said.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
