OL,3,AEight crew missing after drone attack
OL,4,Aleaves tanker ablaze off Romania's
OL,5,Acoast
OL,6,
OL,7,FEight of 12 crew members are missing
OL,8,Fafter a drone attack left a tanker
OL,9,Fablaze off Romania's coast, naval
OL,10,Fauthorities say.
OL,12,FThe San Marino-flagged Wine Trader was
OL,13,F13 nautical miles (24km) east of the
OL,14,Fmouth of the River Danube at Sulina,
OL,15,Fwhen it reported blasts and a fire on
OL,16,FThursday morning. Romanian President
OL,17,FNicuHYor Dan later confirmed it was
OL,18,Fstruck by drones.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
